invalid type: string "Will EVs Dampen the Oil Price Shock?\nVersion 1.0\nResearch Report — For Educational and RAG Pipeline Use\nPage 14\n For policymakers in oil-importing nations, the emerging consensus that EV adoption will\nprogressively dampen — but not eliminate — oil price shock exposure carries several\nies, particularly in South and Southeast Asia, sub-Saharan Africa, and the Middle